# --- Porting-phase scaffolding -------------------------------------------
# A copy of the SSG dashboard repo, kept only while the reconciliation logic
# is being ported. Never commit it: it can carry buyer PII and account data.
# Must stay in sync with .dockerignore — .gitignore alone does not stop a
# broad `COPY . .` from baking it into an image layer.
reference/

# Captured provider snapshots used by the parity harness. These contain real
# order and transaction data, including buyer PII.
snapshots/
testdata/parity/*/input/

# --- Local-only project docs ---------------------------------------------
# Kept out of version control by request. NOTE: docs/PARITY.md is the record
# that CLAUDE.md guardrail 2 requires ("recorded here, with a reason"), so
# while it is ignored, that ledger exists only on this machine — it is not
# shared, reviewed, or backed up with the repo.
CLAUDE.md
docs/

# --- Secrets --------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.toml
.streamlit/

